            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="118" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:04,593</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:07,796</end-time>
                <translation>释迦牟尼去世至今已有2500年</translation>
                <original>お釈迦様が亡くなってからもう2500年たってます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="119" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:07,796</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:10,067</end-time>
                <translation>在这段时间里 许多人</translation>
                <original>その間に様々な人たちが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="120" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:10,067</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:13,468</end-time>
                <translation>创造了具有新思想的佛教流派</translation>
                <original>新しい考えの仏教を作り出していきました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="121" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:13,468</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:15,868</end-time>
                <translation>他们希望能救人们脱离痛苦</translation>
                <original>で人々の苦しみを救いたい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="122" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:15,868</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:18,442</end-time>
                <translation>或者以某种方式消除自己的痛苦</translation>
                <original>あるいは自分の苦しみを何とか消したい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="123" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:18,442</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:21,143</end-time>
                <translation>于是开辟出了新的道路</translation>
                <original>と願う人たちの新しい道が生まれてくるんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="124" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:21,143</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:23,343</end-time>
                <translation>那就是大乘佛教
それが大乗仏教</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="125" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:23,343</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:28,858</end-time>
                <translation>我们准备了一幅图</translation>
                <original>今先生の話にありました大乗仏教をイメージしたものを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="126" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:28,858</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:31,518</end-time>
                <translation>用来表现刚才老师提到的大乘佛教</translation>
                <original>こちらに準備いたしました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="127" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:31,518</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:33,568</end-time>
                <translation>很多人都坐在船上呢</translation>
                <original>大勢の人がこれ船に乗っていますね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="128" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:33,568</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:34,593</end-time>
                <translation>是呢</translation>
                <original>そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="129" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:34,593</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:38,993</end-time>
                <translation>“大乘”的意思 就是大型的载具</translation>
                <original>大乗という言葉は大きな乗り物という意味です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="130" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:38,993</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:41,298</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 前往觉悟的世界</translation>
                <original>つまり悟りの世界へ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="131" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:41,298</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:42,718</end-time>
                <translation>不是独自一人前去</translation>
                <original>一人で行くのではなくて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="132" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:42,718</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:44,318</end-time>
                <translation>而是大家一起乘上这个大型载具</translation>
                <original>みんながこの大きな乗り物</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="133" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:44,318</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:46,837</end-time>
                <translation>这便是大乘佛教的教义</translation>
                <original>これが大乗仏教の教えですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="134" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:46,837</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:49,993</end-time>
                <translation>大家一起乘上大乘佛教这艘船</translation>
                <original>その大乗仏教の教えにみんなが乗ると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="135" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:49,993</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:51,468</end-time>
                <translation>所有人就能够一同</translation>
                <original>みんながそろって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="136" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:51,468</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:53,210</end-time>
                <translation>抵达觉悟的彼岸</translation>
                <original>悟りの世界に行けますと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="137" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:53,210</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:55,768</end-time>
                <translation>就是这个意思呢</translation>
                <original>そういう意味なんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="138" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:55,768</start-time>
                <end-time>00:05:58,115</end-time>
                <translation>而在大乘佛教中
でこの大乗仏教は</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="139" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:05:58,115</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:00,793</end-time>
                <translation>许多人写下了各种各样的佛经</translation>
                <original>ですからいろんな人がいろんなお経を作ったわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="140" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:00,793</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:04,618</end-time>
                <translation>《般若心经》不过是其中的一部</translation>
                <original>で、般若心経はその中のただの一本です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="141" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:04,618</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:07,057</end-time>
                <translation>而篇幅很长的 举例子来说</translation>
                <original>で、大きなものは例えば</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="142" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:07,057</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:10,127</end-time>
                <translation>有部佛经叫《大般若波罗蜜多经》</translation>
                <original>『大般若波羅蜜多経』というお経がありまして、</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="143" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:10,127</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:12,343</end-time>
                <translation>这个足足有600卷</translation>
                <original>これは600巻</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="144" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:12,343</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:14,340</end-time>
                <translation>那600卷的巨著</translation>
                <original>600巻のものも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="145" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:14,340</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:17,334</end-time>
                <translation>和这262字的《般若心经》
この262文字の般若心経も</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="146" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:17,334</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:21,171</end-time>
                <translation>所要传达的核心内容是一样的吗？</translation>
                <original>言っている真ん中の部分は一緒なんですか？</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="147" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:21,171</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:23,718</end-time>
                <translation>-差不多吗？ -几乎相同</translation>
                <original>-似ている？　-ほぼ同じです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="148" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:23,718</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:27,543</end-time>
                <translation>既然如此 我们还是选262字的吧</translation>
                <original>それだったらぜひこの262文字をいただきたいですね我々が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="149" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:27,543</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:30,993</end-time>
                <translation>都会挑短的嘛</translation>
                <original>短いものに飛びつきますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="150" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:30,993</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:32,778</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院 其实呢</translation>
                <original>伊集院さん 実はですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="151" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:32,778</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:35,598</end-time>
                <translation>我们今天能够读到《般若心经》</translation>
                <original>私たちがこの般若心経を読むことができるのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="152" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:35,598</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:38,718</end-time>
                <translation>要归功于一位人物的伟大成就</translation>
                <original>ある人の偉業のおかげなんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="153" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:38,718</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:39,818</end-time>
                <translation>谁呢？
誰?</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="154" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:39,818</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:41,538</end-time>
                <translation>玄奘三藏
玄奘三蔵です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="155" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:41,538</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:43,203</end-time>
                <translation>他为寻求神圣的佛典</translation>
                <original>聖なる仏典を求めて</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="156" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:43,203</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:45,123</end-time>
                <translation>从中国出发 独自冒着生命危险
中国から命がけで一人</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="157" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:45,123</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:47,393</end-time>
                <translation>远赴印度</translation>
                <original>インドに渡った玄奘三蔵</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="158" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:47,393</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:50,223</end-time>
                <translation>下面就来看看《般若心经》诞生背后的</translation>
                <original>般若心経をこの世に誕生させるまでの</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="159" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:50,223</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:51,583</end-time>
                <translation>这段故事吧</translation>
                <original>物語をご覧ください</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="160" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:51,583</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:55,908</end-time>
                <translation>《般若心经》诞生的秘密</translation>
                <original>般若心経　誕生の秘密</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="161" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:55,908</start-time>
                <end-time>00:06:57,473</end-time>
                <translation>玄奘三藏</translation>
                <original>玄奘三蔵は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="162" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:06:57,473</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:01,008</end-time>
                <translation>是《西游记》中唐三藏的原型</translation>
                <original>『西遊記』の三蔵法師のモデルとして有名ですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="163" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:01,008</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:06,433</end-time>
                <translation>他是活跃于7世纪的真实历史人物
7世紀に活躍した実在の人物です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="164" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:06,433</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:07,816</end-time>
                <translation>24岁时
24歳の時</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="165" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:07,816</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:09,585</end-time>
                <translation>为取得佛教经典</translation>
                <original>仏典を手に入れたいと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="166" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:09,585</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:12,533</end-time>
                <translation>他踏上了从中国前往印度的旅途</translation>
                <original>中国からインドへの旅に出ました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="167" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:12,533</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:15,848</end-time>
                <translation>关于这趟旅程还流传着这样一个故事</translation>
                <original>その旅にはこんな逸話が残されています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="168" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:15,848</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:17,787</end-time>
                <translation>就在离开国境之前
国を出る直前</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="169" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:17,787</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:20,783</end-time>
                <translation>玄奘遇到一位病人
玄奘は一人の病人に出会います</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="170" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:20,783</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:23,029</end-time>
                <translation>玄奘送给他衣服和食物
衣服や食べ物を施すと</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="171" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:23,029</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:26,338</end-time>
                <translation>病人便教给他一句话</translation>
                <original>病人は旅のご加護があるようにと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="172" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:26,338</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:28,523</end-time>
                <translation>祈愿他在旅途中得到庇佑</translation>
                <original>ある言葉を教えてくれました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="173" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:28,523</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:34,263</end-time>
                <translation>揭谛揭谛 波罗揭谛 波罗僧揭谛 菩提萨婆诃
羯諦羯諦 波羅羯諦 波羅僧羯諦 菩提薩婆訶</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="174" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:34,263</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:36,388</end-time>
                <translation>玄奘将这句话牢记在心
玄奘はこの言葉を胸に</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="175" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:36,388</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:39,413</end-time>
                <translation>开始了危险的旅程</translation>
                <original>危険な旅に出かけます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="176" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:39,413</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:42,683</end-time>
                <translation>在死亡沙漠中挡住去路的妖怪
死の砂漠で行く手を塞ぐ化け物</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="177" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:42,683</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:45,078</end-time>
                <translation>就在这时 玄奘
その時玄奘が</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="178" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:45,078</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:49,078</end-time>
                <translation>“揭谛揭谛 波罗揭谛” 念出后
羯諦羯諦波羅羯諦と唱えると</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="179" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:49,078</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:52,123</end-time>
                <translation>妖怪们便惨叫着消失了</translation>
                <original>皆、叫び声を上げて消えていきました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="180" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:52,123</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:55,353</end-time>
                <translation>就这样 传说玄奘克服了重重困难</translation>
                <original>こうして玄奘は苦難の旅を乗り越え</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="181" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:55,353</start-time>
                <end-time>00:07:59,098</end-time>
                <translation>终于到达了印度</translation>
                <original>インドに到達することができたと言い伝えられています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="182" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:07:59,098</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:04,923</end-time>
                <translation>玄奘从印度带回1335卷经典</translation>
                <original>インドから1335巻の経典を中国に持ち帰った玄奘は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="183" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:04,923</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:07,548</end-time>
                <translation>又从全国召集优秀僧人
全国から優秀な僧侶を集め</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="184" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:07,548</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:10,598</end-time>
                <translation>组成了约20人的翻译团队</translation>
                <original>およそ20人の翻訳チームを結成し</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="185" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:10,598</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:12,048</end-time>
                <translation>开始翻译佛经</translation>
                <original>訳に取り掛かりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="186" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:12,048</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:15,773</end-time>
                <translation>这一工作耗费了20年</translation>
                <original>それは20年の歳月を要しました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="187" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:15,773</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:19,773</end-time>
                <translation>一部部经典陆续被译成汉文</translation>
                <original>次々に訳されていく経典の数々</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="188" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:19,773</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:23,673</end-time>
                <translation>其中就有浓缩为262字的</translation>
                <original>その中で262文字に凝縮された</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="189" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:23,673</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:26,323</end-time>
                <translation>《般若心经》
般若心経が完成したのです</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="190" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:26,323</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:30,423</end-time>
                <translation>我以前了解的是那个故事里的唐三藏</translation>
                <original>なんか僕らの知ってるお話の方の</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="191" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:30,423</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:33,348</end-time>
                <translation>—绘本里的《西游记》里的  — 《西游记》
-絵本の方の三蔵法師先にあって、西遊記の　-西遊記の</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="192" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:33,348</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:36,648</end-time>
                <translation>三藏法师 好像到了目的地就结束了</translation>
                <original>三蔵法師だと到達したら終わりな感じじゃないですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="193" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:36,648</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:38,223</end-time>
                <translation>就是到达天竺</translation>
                <original>天竺に行ったら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="194" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:38,223</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:40,588</end-time>
                <translation>但真正重要的是把经书带回去</translation>
                <original>だけどちゃんとお経を持ち帰るということは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="195" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:40,588</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:42,648</end-time>
                <translation>带回去后又花了几十年</translation>
                <original>持ち帰って何十年にわたって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="196" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:42,648</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:44,723</end-time>
                <translation>认真地进行翻译</translation>
                <original>きちんとした翻訳をして</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="197" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:44,723</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:46,448</end-time>
                <translation>再把它传播出去</translation>
                <original>ちゃんと広めるという</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="198" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:46,448</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:47,208</end-time>
                <translation>原来是这样啊</translation>
                <original>そういうことなんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="199" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:47,208</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:50,028</end-time>
                <translation>这正是玄奘三藏最大的功绩</translation>
                <original>もうそれが玄奘三蔵の一番の功績なんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="200" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:50,028</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:53,223</end-time>
                <translation>他从印度带回中国并翻译的</translation>
                <original>そしてそうやってインドから中国に持ち帰って訳した</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="201" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:53,223</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:56,348</end-time>
                <translation>其中一部佛经就是《般若心经》</translation>
                <original>お経の一つがこの般若心経だったということなんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="202" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:56,348</start-time>
                <end-time>00:08:59,523</end-time>
                <translation>而且他的译文确实非常出色</translation>
                <original>それが本当に素晴らしい翻訳なんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="203" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:08:59,523</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:02,148</end-time>
                <translation>你觉得他的翻译和编辑能力中</translation>
                <original>その翻訳とか編集の腕で</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="204" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:02,148</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:04,463</end-time>
                <translation>最了不起的地方</translation>
                <original>特に素晴らしいなって思われるところ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="205" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:04,463</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:05,303</end-time>
                <translation>具体是什么呢？</translation>
                <original>ってどういうところですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="206" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:05,303</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:07,083</end-time>
                <translation>首先是他真正理解了经文的内容</translation>
                <original>やはり内容を理解して</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="207" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:07,083</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:07,973</end-time>
                <translation>在思想层面
思想的に</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="208" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:07,973</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:10,573</end-time>
                <translation>也能把意义准确地译出来</translation>
                <original>しっかりとそれを翻訳しているところもありますし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="209" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:10,573</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:13,623</end-time>
                <translation>除此之外 他还会选择不翻译</translation>
                <original>それから翻訳をせずに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="210" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:13,623</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:16,748</end-time>
                <translation>直接保留原来的声音</translation>
                <original>そのまま音を残して</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="211" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:16,748</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:19,273</end-time>
                <translation>也就是保留印度语言的发音</translation>
                <original>つまりインドの音を残したまま</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="212" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:19,273</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:21,123</end-time>
                <translation>再用汉字来表示那些声音</translation>
                <original>漢字で置き換えていく</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="213" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:21,123</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:24,103</end-time>
                <translation>也就是音译</translation>
                <original>音写をするということに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="214" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:24,103</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:26,648</end-time>
                <translation>他在这方面的能力尤其出色</translation>
                <original>もう素晴らしい能力があるんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="215" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:26,648</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:28,298</end-time>
                <translation>这真是高超的技巧啊</translation>
                <original>それはすごいテクニックですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="216" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:28,298</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:30,698</end-time>
                <translation>我不知道该用什么来比喻</translation>
                <original>なんか僕何に例えていいのかわからないけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="217" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:30,698</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:32,948</end-time>
                <translation>比如说 一首美国的热门歌曲</translation>
                <original>例えばねアメリカのヒット曲</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="218" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:32,948</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:34,173</end-time>
                <translation>要翻唱成日语版
日本語版にする</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="219" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:34,173</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:36,748</end-time>
                <translation>既得保留原来歌曲的魅力</translation>
                <original>そのヒット曲の良さを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="220" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:36,748</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:38,563</end-time>
                <translation>又得有保留</translation>
                <original>その残しながら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="221" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:38,563</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:40,998</end-time>
                <translation>保留它声音上的美感</translation>
                <original>その音の良さも残しながら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="222" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:40,998</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:45,023</end-time>
                <translation>还要适应有日本本土化的改变</translation>
                <original>日本の文化にも通じるようにしなきゃいけないし</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="223" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:45,023</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:46,123</end-time>
                <translation>要决定哪些部分保留下来</translation>
                <original>っていう作業が</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="224" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:46,123</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:48,998</end-time>
                <translation>光是把握这个比例就很困难</translation>
                <original>まあその残す割合も大変なら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="225" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:48,998</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:52,323</end-time>
                <translation>总不能把它变成一首完全原创的歌吧</translation>
                <original>完全オリジナル曲にしちゃうわけにはいかないじゃないですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="226" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:52,323</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:55,883</end-time>
                <translation>也就是说 他是这方面的顶尖高手？</translation>
                <original>それの超優れてる版っていうことですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="227" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:55,883</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:56,573</end-time>
                <translation>正是如此</translation>
                <original>そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="228" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:09:56,573</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:01,848</end-time>
                <translation>玄奘三藏在翻译方面尤其出色</translation>
                <original>特に玄奘三蔵はそういう翻訳の能力に優れていましたね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="229" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:10:01,848</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:03,422</end-time>
                <translation>不过 为什么要对声音</translation>
                <original>なんでこの音に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="230" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:10:03,422</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:04,773</end-time>
                <translation>如此执着呢？</translation>
                <original>そこまでこだわっているんですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="231" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:10:04,773</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:05,298</end-time>
                <translation>为什么非要音译呢？</translation>
                <original>音写ということに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="232" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:10:05,298</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:07,023</end-time>
                <translation>是这样的</translation>
                <original>それはですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="233" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:10:07,023</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:11,723</end-time>
                <translation>能从道理上理解的部分 应该正常翻译</translation>
                <original>理屈でわかる部分はちゃんと普通に翻訳すべきですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="234" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:10:11,723</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:15,023</end-time>
                <translation>但有些时候 声音本身就具有意义</translation>
                <original>そうではなくてその音が意味を持っている場合もあります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="235" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:10:15,023</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:18,163</end-time>
                <translation>而其中最核心的部分</translation>
                <original>その中でも一番核心ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="236" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:10:18,163</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:21,323</end-time>
                <translation>甚至可以说是《般若心经》的精髓</translation>
                <original>般若心経のまたその中のエッセンスというのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="237" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:10:21,323</start-time>
                <end-time>00:10:23,743</end-time>
                <translation>就是用音译保留下来的</translation>
