            <t hasRuby="0" index="321" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:23,053</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:23,573</end-time>
                <translation>是的</translation>
                <original>そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="322" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:23,573</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:24,908</end-time>
                <translation>在《般若心经》里
般若心経の中の</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="323" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:24,908</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:28,133</end-time>
                <translation>有“照见五蕴皆空”
照見五蘊皆空</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="324" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:28,133</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:30,558</end-time>
                <translation>以及“度一切苦厄”</translation>
                <original>そして度一切苦厄</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="325" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:30,558</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:32,183</end-time>
                <translation>在这句话中出现了它</translation>
                <original>この言葉の中に出てきます</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="326" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:32,183</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:36,708</end-time>
                <translation>什么是五蕴？
五蘊とは？</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="327" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:36,708</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:39,583</end-time>
                <translation>首先 我们都认为自己是一个独立的人</translation>
                <original>まず我々は一つの人間として</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="328" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:39,583</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:41,753</end-time>
                <translation>比如西方哲学中</translation>
                <original>例えば西洋哲学でいうと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="329" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:41,753</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:44,008</end-time>
                <translation>有“我思故我在”这样的说法</translation>
                <original>我思う、ゆえに我ありというような</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="330" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:44,008</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:46,593</end-time>
                <translation>我们相信有一个叫作“我”的存在</translation>
                <original>我というのはあると思い込んでいますが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="331" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:46,593</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:48,008</end-time>
                <translation>总觉得自己确实存在</translation>
                <original>あると思っていますが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="332" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:48,008</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:50,283</end-time>
                <translation>但佛教认为并没有这样一个实体</translation>
                <original>仏教ではそんなものはないんだと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="333" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:50,283</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:52,913</end-time>
                <translation>所谓的“我”只是一种暂时的形态</translation>
                <original>私というのは仮の姿だと言うんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="334" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:52,913</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:55,719</end-time>
                <translation>于是便要追问</translation>
                <original>でその仮の姿の私を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="335" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:55,719</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:57,321</end-time>
                <translation>构成这个暂时的“我”的</translation>
                <original>構成している</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="336" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:57,321</start-time>
                <end-time>00:14:58,858</end-time>
                <translation>究竟有哪些要素</translation>
                <original>その要素は何ですかと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="337" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:14:58,858</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:01,291</end-time>
                <translation>它是由什么东西集合而成的</translation>
                <original>何が集まってできているんですかと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="338" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:01,291</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:02,933</end-time>
                <translation>思考这个问题时</translation>
                <original>いうものを考えた時に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="339" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:02,933</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:05,333</end-time>
                <translation>佛教认为有五种要素</translation>
                <original>仏教ではそれは5つだと言うんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="340" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:05,333</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:07,183</end-time>
                <translation>那就是“五蕴”</translation>
                <original>それが五蘊です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="341" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:07,183</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:08,908</end-time>
                <translation>这里已经列出来了</translation>
                <original>ですからここに挙げましたね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="342" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:08,908</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:10,413</end-time>
                <translation>我们从这里开始看</translation>
                <original>ここからいきましょうね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="343" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:10,413</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:13,737</end-time>
                <translation>色 受 想</translation>
                <original>色、受、想、</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="344" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:13,737</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:16,183</end-time>
                <translation>行 识</translation>
                <original>行、識ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="345" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:16,183</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:18,942</end-time>
                <translation>从这幅图可以看出</translation>
                <original>で、この図でお分かりのとおりに、</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="346" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:18,942</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:20,911</end-time>
                <translation>首先是“色”这一项</translation>
                <original>まず色でこれ一つ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="347" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:20,911</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:21,833</end-time>
                <translation>这里用一个部分来表示</translation>
                <original>表してますが、</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="348" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:21,833</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:24,583</end-time>
                <translation>指的是我们的肉体</translation>
                <original>これは私の肉体です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="349" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:24,583</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:27,158</end-time>
                <translation>也就是构成身体的物质</translation>
                <original>体を作っている物質ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="350" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:27,158</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:31,188</end-time>
                <translation>其余四种则是内心的活动</translation>
                <original>で残りの4つは、これは私の心の中の働きを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="351" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:31,188</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:33,483</end-time>
                <translation>又进一步分成四个方面</translation>
                <original>さらに4つに分けています</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="352" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:33,483</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:34,892</end-time>
                <translation>其中“受”是指</translation>
                <original>で受というのは</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="353" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:34,892</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:37,608</end-time>
                <translation>面对来自外界的各种</translation>
                <original>外からのさまざまな</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="354" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:37,608</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:39,508</end-time>
                <translation>刺激时 我们如何</translation>
                <original>刺激に対して私がそれを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="355" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:39,508</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:41,258</end-time>
                <translation>接受这些刺激</translation>
                <original>どう受け取るか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="356" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:41,258</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:44,168</end-time>
                <translation>而“想”是指</translation>
                <original>で想というのはその</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="357" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:44,168</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:46,353</end-time>
                <translation>面对已经接收到的信息</translation>
                <original>受け取った情報に対して</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="358" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:46,353</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:49,673</end-time>
                <translation>我们主动地</translation>
                <original>私がこちらから積極的に何かを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="359" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:49,673</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:52,458</end-time>
                <translation>构想或思考出某种东西</translation>
                <original>こう作り上げて考えることです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="360" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:52,458</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:54,533</end-time>
                <translation>—就是想象吗？ —是的</translation>
                <original>-想像するということですかね　-そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="361" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:54,533</start-time>
                <end-time>00:15:59,608</end-time>
                <translation>“行”基本上指想要做某事的意志活动</translation>
                <original>行は本質的には私は何かをするぞという意志作用ですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="362" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:15:59,608</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:02,608</end-time>
                <translation>“识”就是认识和识别</translation>
                <original>識というのは、これは認識ですから</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="363" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:02,608</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:04,188</end-time>
                <translation>把从外界传入的信息</translation>
                <original>外から入ってきた情報</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="364" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:04,188</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:06,933</end-time>
                <translation>或者心灵所捕捉的信息</translation>
                <original>あるいは心が捉えた情報を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="365" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:06,933</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:10,058</end-time>
                <translation>如实而中性地映现在心里</translation>
                <original>心の中にそのままニュートラルに映し出す</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="366" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:10,058</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:11,033</end-time>
                <translation>就是这样的作用</translation>
                <original>そういう働き</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="367" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:11,033</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:14,164</end-time>
                <translation>这就是佛教原本所说的
これが仏教が本来的に言う</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="368" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:14,164</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:15,908</end-time>
                <translation>我们每个人的构成方式</translation>
                <original>私たちの在り方なんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="369" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:15,908</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:18,368</end-time>
                <translation>然而《般若心经》
しかし般若心経は</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="370" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:18,368</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:21,305</end-time>
                <translation>竟然把这一切都说成是“空”</translation>
                <original>それを要はそれを空だと言ってしまう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="371" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:21,305</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:22,883</end-time>
                <translation>太厉害了</translation>
                <original>すごいですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="372" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:22,883</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:25,709</end-time>
                <translation>我听到这里已经很认同了</translation>
                <original>こんなに、僕ここですごい納得しましたもん</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="373" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:25,709</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:27,311</end-time>
                <translation>一提到“我究竟是什么”</translation>
                <original>自分とは何だって言われたら</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="374" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:27,311</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:29,113</end-time>
                <translation>原来如此 这些全都是“我”的组成部分</translation>
                <original>なるほどこれ全部自分なんだ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="375" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:29,113</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:31,815</end-time>
                <translation>先让我产生了这样的理解</translation>
                <original>っていう納得がまずあって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="376" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:31,815</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:35,583</end-time>
                <translation>—结果连这些都是空？ —没错</translation>
                <original>-それすら空だとそう　-そうですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="377" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:16:35,583</start-time>
                <end-time>00:16:38,188</end-time>
                <translation>先进行了一番彻底的分析</translation>
                <original>いったん徹底的に分析した上で</original>
