                <start-time>00:19:40,588</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:42,337</end-time>
                <translation>就有可能被那些并非由自己决定的</translation>
                <original>自分が決めたのではない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="446" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:19:42,337</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:44,078</end-time>
                <translation>而是别人规定的概念
他人が決めた概念で</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="447" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:19:44,078</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:46,768</end-time>
                <translation>操纵着去做出不同的行动</translation>
                <original>操られて違った行動を取る</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="448" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:19:46,768</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:48,653</end-time>
                <translation>甚至做出错误的判断</translation>
                <original>違った判断をする危険性があります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="449" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:19:48,653</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:51,408</end-time>
                <translation>所以即使面对同样的事物</translation>
                <original>ですから同じものがあるにしても</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="450" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:19:51,408</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:53,748</end-time>
                <translation>我们一旦断言“它就是这样的”</translation>
                <original>それを我々がこれはこうであるというふうに</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="451" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:19:53,748</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:57,678</end-time>
                <translation>其中就不可避免地会出现错误</translation>
                <original>決めつけて言うことには必ずそこには間違いが入ってくるわけです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="452" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:19:57,678</start-time>
                <end-time>00:19:58,978</end-time>
                <translation>的确会有那种奇怪的感觉</translation>
                <original>変な感じになるもんね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="453" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:19:58,978</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:00,928</end-time>
                <translation>比如一个第一次见面的人</translation>
                <original>なんか初めて会う人なんだけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="454" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:00,928</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:05,953</end-time>
                <translation>朋友提前说“那家伙很讨厌”</translation>
                <original>もう一人の友達から「あいつ嫌な奴だから」って聞かされて会うと</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="455" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:05,953</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:07,696</end-time>
                <translation>见了面即使并不觉得他讨厌</translation>
                <original>嫌な奴に見えないけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="456" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:07,696</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:10,248</end-time>
                <translation>也会先入为主 开始想这家伙应该蛮讨厌的</translation>
                <original>こいつ嫌な奴なんだろうなって思って話するじゃない</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="457" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:10,248</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:13,403</end-time>
                <translation>谣言不就是这么传开的吗？</translation>
                <original>なんかそんなんで噂って広がっていくじゃないですか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="458" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:13,403</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:17,103</end-time>
                <translation>当然 说他讨厌或许也有真实的一面</translation>
                <original>でもその嫌な奴も、もしかしたら真実かもしれないんだけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="459" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:17,103</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:19,253</end-time>
                <translation>但不应该认为那就是全部事实</translation>
                <original>全部真実じゃないぐらいの気持ちで、</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="460" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:19,253</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:22,178</end-time>
                <translation>而是从各种角度去看</translation>
                <original>いろんな角度から見て</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="461" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:22,178</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:25,353</end-time>
                <translation>自然就会发现事物有不同的样子</translation>
                <original>考えると、いろんな見え方がして当然っていう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="462" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:25,353</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:27,315</end-time>
                <translation>那么回到《般若心经》</translation>
                <original>じゃあ般若心経に戻ると、</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="463" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:27,315</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:30,752</end-time>
                <translation>《般若心经》里对于“空”究竟是什么？</translation>
                <original>その般若心経にはその空というものがどういうものかっていうことが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="464" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:30,752</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:32,678</end-time>
                <translation>—有明确解释么 —嗯 有的</translation>
                <original>-書いてあるわけですか　-そうですねそうです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="465" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:32,678</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:35,757</end-time>
                <translation>能准确把握《般若心经》中</translation>
                <original>この般若心経の中に説かれている</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="466" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:35,757</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:38,660</end-time>
                <translation>所阐释的“空”之后</translation>
                <original>その空というものをしっかり理解することで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="467" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:38,660</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:42,330</end-time>
                <translation>我们便能够把平时看待事物的方式</translation>
                <original>私たちは普段の私たちのものの見方を</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="468" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:42,330</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:44,153</end-time>
                <translation>来一个180度的大转变
180度</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="469" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:44,153</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:45,728</end-time>
                <translation>而且是非常惊人的</translation>
                <original>それもすごい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="470" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:45,728</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:49,971</end-time>
                <translation>一瞬之间完成的转变</translation>
                <original>すごく速いスピードでパッと転換することができる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="471" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:49,971</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:51,553</end-time>
                <translation>这就是经文所说的</translation>
                <original>というふうに言われているんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="472" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:51,553</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:53,175</end-time>
                <translation>借由这种转变</translation>
                <original>でそれによって我々は</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="473" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:53,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:56,778</end-time>
                <translation>我们就能够踏上</translation>
                <original>今までとは全く違う生き方に</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="474" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:56,778</start-time>
                <end-time>00:20:58,853</end-time>
                <translation>与过去完全不同的人生道路</translation>
                <original>足を踏み入れることができる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="475" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:20:58,853</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:02,028</end-time>
                <translation>哇 这样想来“空”还真是厉害啊</translation>
                <original>うわ、すごいな空ってすごいな、そう考えると</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="476" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:21:02,028</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:05,620</end-time>
                <translation>那么“空”究竟是什么呢？</translation>
                <original>では、このまあ、空とは一体どういうものなのか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="477" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:21:05,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:06,953</end-time>
                <translation>这个问题</translation>
                <original>ということをですね、</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="478" vertical="0" time="" torder="1" id="">
                <start-time>00:21:06,953</start-time>
                <end-time>00:21:10,443</end-time>
                <translation>我们将从下一回开始具体探讨</translation>
                <original>次回から具体的に見ていきたいと思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
